# Secrets for the SERVICES behind the gateway: one variable per `secret =`
# line in services.ini. This file is the only extra env the nginx container
# gets, so your Cloudflare API token never reaches it.
#
# Same rule as the gateway secrets: 24+ chars of A-Z a-z 0-9 _
# (try: openssl rand -hex 32). Never commit the real proxy.env.
#
# Service URL this unlocks:
#   https://<worker>/<URL_SECRET>.<MCP_SHELL_SECRET>/mcp/shell

MCP_SHELL_SECRET=""

# MCP_FILES_SECRET=""
